flowchart LR

IN2["`◀ from 2 · enqueued work`"]

BRK["`Redis broker`"]
BRK_N["`db1 broker · db2 results
the queue distributes, not the load balancer`"]
BRK -.- BRK_N

WRK["`Celery worker`"]
WRK_N["`same image as the API
task_acks_late + idempotent tasks = at-least-once
NOT exactly-once, and it does not pretend to be
prefetch 1 · retry 15s, 30s, 60s, then FAILED
NullPool engine, event-loop safe`"]
WRK -.- WRK_N

P1["`fetch object`"]
P2["`parse to Markdown`"]
P2_N["`pdf · docx · pptx · xlsx · txt · md
converting structure, not scraping text`"]
P2 -.- P2_N
P3["`header-aware chunk`"]
P3_N["`~1000 chars + overlap
a blind cut separates a heading
from the paragraph it governs`"]
P3 -.- P3_N
P4["`embed`"]
P4_N["`bge-m3, batches of 8, progress published
93% of ingestion time is this call`"]
P4 -.- P4_N
P5["`index`"]
P5_N["`status to INDEXED · INDEXED = no-op
stale PROCESSING is taken over
failure to FAILED + reason, visible at /status`"]
P5 -.- P5_N

GENT["`generation.run_item`"]
GENT_N["`one task per academic item, FAST tier
each retrieves its own RAG context
run recomputed: RUNNING / COMPLETED / PARTIAL
PARTIAL is deliberate: item 31 failing must not
destroy the other 39`"]
GENT -.- GENT_N

MAILT["`emails.send`"]
MAILT_N["`password reset · email verification`"]
MAILT -.- MAILT_N

DLQ["`Dead letter queue`"]
DLQ_N["`Celery+Redis has none, so this is built
a Redis list of tasks that exhausted retries
carries task, args and error · capped at 1000
alerts: Growing and Backlog · has a runbook
emails are NOT replayable, no body stored
every entry is somebody: a document nobody
can search, a plan that never filled in`"]
DLQ -.- DLQ_N

FLW["`Flower :5555`"]
FLW_N["`per-task detail Prometheus cannot give
aggregates say something is wrong,
this says which one`"]
FLW -.- FLW_N

OUT3["`▶ continues in 3 · AI (FAST tier)`"]
OUT5["`▶ continues in 5 · DATA`"]
OUT6["`▶ continues in 6 · OBSERVABILITY`"]

IN2 ==> BRK
BRK ==>|"deliver task"| WRK
WRK --> P1
P1 --> P2 --> P3 --> P4 --> P5
WRK --> GENT
WRK --> MAILT
WRK -.->|"retries exhausted"| DLQ
GENT ==> OUT3
P4 -->|"embeddings"| OUT5
P5 -->|"content + chunks + tsvector"| OUT5
GENT -->|"content + academic_item_source"| OUT5
FLW -.-> BRK
WRK -.-> OUT6

